<title>UK: BayerLB prices 200 million stg Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB prices 200 million stg Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced</p>
<p>earlier by lead manager CS First Boston, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.435   PAY DATE   *20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.81     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT GILT DUE 2001</p>
<p> NOTES     *LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
